Greengram's web client is Web A with changes. The source is not copied into
this repository: scripts/build-web.sh downloads it at a pinned commit and
applies web/telegram-web-a.patch, which is a modified version of Web A's
source under GPL-3.0. The built client is distributed under GPL-3.0; its
source is that commit plus the patch.

Files in this repository derived from Web A (GPL-3.0):
- internal/site/premium-logo.svg, internal/site/stars-logo.svg: Web A's
  PremiumStar.svg and GoldStar.svg.
- internal/builtin/avatars/premium_payments.jpg, stars_payments.jpg: the
  same two pictures, rasterized.

web/brand/ and internal/admin/logo.png are Greengram's own icons and replace
Web A's in the build.
